 "description": "<p><b>Overview:</b></p><p>[With&nbsp;LED&nbsp;Light]&nbsp;This&nbsp;dog&nbsp;paw&nbsp;trimmer&nbsp;is&nbsp;designed&nbsp;with&nbsp;LED&nbsp;light,&nbsp;allowing&nbsp;you&nbsp;easily&nbsp;and&nbsp;quickly&nbsp;to&nbsp;see&nbsp;the&nbsp;skin&nbsp;of&nbsp;your&nbsp;pet.&nbsp;<br/>[Improve&nbsp;Trimming&nbsp;Efficiency]&nbsp;This&nbsp;dog&nbsp;clipper&nbsp;with an 18mm&nbsp;widened&nbsp;stainless&nbsp;steel&nbsp;blade&nbsp;increases&nbsp;the&nbsp;shaving&nbsp;area&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;efficiency&nbsp;of&nbsp;trimming&nbsp;in&nbsp;small&nbsp;areas.&nbsp;<br/>[LED&nbsp;Display]&nbsp;This&nbsp;dog&nbsp;paw&nbsp;trimmer&nbsp;is&nbsp;equipped&nbsp;with a smart&nbsp;LED&nbsp;screen&nbsp;that&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;displays&nbsp;3&nbsp;key&nbsp;statuses:&nbsp;Running,&nbsp;Full&nbsp;Charge,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Charging&nbsp;Reminder.&nbsp;<br/>[Cordless&nbsp;and&nbsp;500mAh&nbsp;Rechargeable]&nbsp;This&nbsp;dog&nbsp;clipper&nbsp;features&nbsp;a&nbsp;lightweight&nbsp;cordless&nbsp;design&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;portable.&nbsp;</p><p><br/></p><p><b>Product Information:</b><br/>Color: White<br/>Material: ABS<br/>Specification: f5<br/>Power: 5W<br/>Voltage: 3.7V<br/>Size: 16 * 3cm<br/></p><p>Battery life: about two hours<br/>Charging time: about an hour</p><p><br/><b>Packing List:</b><br/>Pet shaver * 1 （it doesn't come with the oil bottle）</p><p><br/></p><p><b>Product Image:</b><br/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17206560/2407110630540324200.jpg\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17206560/2407110630540324600.jpg\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17206560/2407110630540325700.jpg\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17206560/2407110630540326200.jpg\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17206560/2407110630540326700.jpg\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17206560/2407110630550324900.jpg\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17206560/2407110630560321100.jpg\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://c